id: pm-wi301j
title: "GH-794: make copied identity output_format overrides decline instead of exposing the host envelope"
description: "An output_format service override that shallow-copies and returns its input claims the host wrapper and replaces every command output with internal global/format/options/result fields. Extend the public SDK decision contract so semantic identity is safe, typed, and diagnosable."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-07-28T11:30:25.680Z"
updated_at: "2026-07-28T16:31:01.480Z"
closed_at: "2026-07-28T16:27:47.719Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 150
acceptance_criteria: Reference-identical and semantically identical output payloads decline safely; intentional handled output remains possible through ServiceOverrideDecision; output_format payload and replacement semantics are typed and documented; pm-ts-starter cannot corrupt list or health envelopes; isolated installed-package regressions cover JSON and TOON
goal: project management = context management
objective: Make SDK output override ownership safe for natural identity implementations
value: Package authors can customize output without silently breaking every agent consumer
parent: pm-usfg
risk: high
confidence: high
resolution: fixed
expected_result: Copied identity overrides decline; explicit handled decisions replace output.
actual_result: Semantic equality now declines copied host envelopes and explicit decisions remain supported.
